Z||000000||Taijiguy||05-15-2001||08:38 AM||||I'm in the process of creating various LED lighting systems, including tail light conversions, that would allow the removal of the red diffuser, as well as custom designs, (such as the Pontiac crest, or the Fiero crest, your cars name, whatever...)instrumentation/dash lighting in almost any color you want(including a system that would allow changing the color between green/red with the flip of a switch)and a major improvement over the reflective system, and an enhancement to the backlit method, and also concealed mirror mounted turn indicators. How much interest is there in any of this, before I get all crazy and start ordering parts. Also, just as an idea, if you could order a digital dash with custom capabilities, what kinds of things would you want? I'm talking about a programmable dash, limited only by your imagination, what kind of things would you like to have?<BR>I'm just looking for input and ideas.<BR>Grazie<BR>~Taiji<p>[This message has been edited by Taijiguy (edited 05-15-2001).]||||reg||3
