Z||000024||cadaver||05-16-2001||06:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Loki:<BR><B>Changing the color of the dash lighting is ALOT more involved than painting the bulbs...There is a plate thats painted in a florescent orange/red that the white bulbs reflect off of<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>But Fierolisa's car is  a GT so it has backlighted guages so this does not apply.<P>And all you would have to do is just paint those reflective surfaces white or silver and then paint the bulbs. Just dont use a heavy paint. Use a glass or translucent paint. Yes it works. My 67 Mustang has red lights now.<P>||||reg||1
